      }
     ],
     "id": "9b85b6a5-7ace-4c5c-92cd-837508f3aa9b"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## twist and monodromy\n\ncompanion twist, with eigenvalues z[1] and z[2].",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[G, T, Tt];\n\n(*twist matrix*)\nG = {{z[1] + z[2], -z[1] z[2]}, {1, 0}};\n\n(*monodromy matrix - polynomial*)\nT[{i_, j_}][u_] := T[{i, j}][u] = Sum[KroneckerProduct[LL[1][{i, k}][u - w[1]], LL[2][{k, j}][u - w[2]]], {k, 2}];\n\n(*monodromy matrix normalized by first Yangian weight*)\nTt[{i_, j_}][u_] := Tt[{i, j}][u] = T[{i, j}][u] / nu[1][u];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## transfer matrices\n\nthe {1,s} tower, built by fusion. the shifts run upwards, in steps of +h.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "ClearAll[t];\n(*t[{a,s}] corresponds to transfer matrix with a rows and s columns*)\n\nt[{1, 0}][u_] = IdentityMatrix[dim[Lam[1]] dim[Lam[2]]];\nt[{1, 1}][u_] = (z[1] + z[2]) Tt[{1, 1}][u] - z[1] z[2] Tt[{2, 1}][u] + Tt[{1, 2}][u];\nt[{2, 1}][u_] = z[1] z[2] (Tt[{1, 1}][u].Tt[{2, 2}][u - h] - Tt[{2, 1}][u].Tt[{1, 2}][u - h]);\n\n(*building transfer matrices in higher reps by fusion*)\nt[{1, s_ /; s >= 2}][u_] = t[{1, s - 1}][u].t[{1, 1}][u + (s - 1) h] - t[{2, 1}][u + (s - 1) h].t[{1, s - 2}][u];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## the B operator and the SoV basis\n\nx[{0,0}] is the lowest weight state on both sites, and the transfer matrices excite it.\nthe labels mu[n] count upwards from zero.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*B operator in companion frame is simply T[{1,1}][u]*)\nBB[u_] = T[{1, 1}][u];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*SoV basis. x[{0,0}] is SoV vacuum*)\nx[{0, 0}] = {Table[KroneckerDelta[dim[Lam[1]] dim[Lam[2]], ii], {ii, dim[Lam[1]] dim[Lam[2]]}]};\nx[{mu1_, mu2_}] := x[{0, 0}].t[{1, mu1}][w[1]].t[{1, mu2}][w[2]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*SoV states built with transfer matrices above diagonalize B operator*)\nTable[x[{mu1, mu2}].BB[u] - (u - w[1] - h mu1) (u - w[2] - h mu2) x[{mu1, mu2}], {mu1, 0, 3}, {mu2, 0, 3}] // Simplify // Flatten // Union",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"928824\" data-output-id=\"34\" data-out-n=\"167\" data-sub-idx=\"1\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"13\" data-sub-start=\"1\" data-sub-end=\"1\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[167]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"13\" data-latex-b64=\"XGxlZnRcezBccmlnaHRcfQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">{</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[167]= \\left\\{0\\right\\}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d34284fd-8087-4b26-8e2f-1c0c2967cf1d"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## localization\n\nthe states with the second label unexcited turn out to factorize across the two sites.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(*localization - the states x[{mu,0}] are localized to the first site of the chain*)\nTable[x[{mu1, 0}] - KroneckerProduct[{{v[mu1][1], v[mu1][2], v[mu1][3], v[mu1][4]}}, {{0, 0, 0, 1}}], {mu1, 0, 3}];\nSolve[% == 0]〚1〛",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
